      "activity_name": "U2: Unit tests",
      "activity_description": "Add unit tests verifying the unsigned ConfigUpdateEnvelope output and that it can later be signed via external tooling (peer channel commands flow).",
      "most_likely_effort": 1
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A06",
      "activity_name": "U3: Implement RemoveLegacyOrdererAddresses and orderer-address policy changes",
      "activity_description": "Implement RemoveLegacyOrdererAddresses on the ConfigTx channel group, remove the ability to set/update the top-level OrdererAddresses field, and change genesis block creation to omit the top-level field while requiring orderer endpoints at the org level (optional on update).",
      "most_likely_effort": 2
